ratorname{arcsin}⁡(2x)) \\\\  & =4\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(2x)^{2}}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2x) \\\\  & =4\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-4{x}^{2}}}\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{1-4{x}^{2}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-86179/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "552973a7-4ab5-5918-83f4-15ee0e3ee052"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-86179"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-110049/selection/8a5ed2b16066ecd57e8d8fa26f0568ae2b8c4110ce326fe227dc55ae1c8a08a1" :answer/id #uuid "b4acabf1-5c6f-5007-b17b-e0b635de11c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4{arcsin}^{4}⁡(4x)}{\\sqrt{1-16{x}^{2}}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110049/selection/b300b39d1c285318ec480ab2055413d766d70234191d2d21cf00732bbb276e37" :answer/id #uuid "c23d1040-1d8e-5108-b571-ca5eeec240b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{20{arcsin}^{4}⁡(4x)}{\\sqrt{1-16{x}^{2}}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110049/selection/fc77e15eb9a2377afd527c9d69454d5c081d07665c06fccbf08478173cced3ef" :answer/id #uuid "d4a4a4c4-ca44-5d53-b155-95a1cd7de3ab" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{20{arcsin}^{2}⁡(4x)}{\\sqrt{1-4{x}^{2}}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110049/selection/bc560fd2355788cb53b3af38d0a3c35a7a794f756632d0f2a6ef6b854c5fd9fc" :answer/id #uuid "56966280-435a-5f10-9aa9-f094ac59a4c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5{arcsin}^{4}⁡(4x)}{\\sqrt{1-4{x}^{2}}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110049/selection/aec3820c443bdfddbde17f6efac94c74a827e3ab2e31ab50b2dbc074a87c7cf5" :answer/id #uuid "56905950-f720-59be-b08c-48032c9555f8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5{arcsin}^{4}⁡(2x)}{\\sqrt{1-16{x}^{2}}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110049/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "06c317c7-d416-5f37-860b-3dd149b5e6f1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-110049/selection/b300b39d1c285318ec480ab2055413d766d70234191d2d21cf00732bbb276e37" :answer-field/choices ["q-110049/selection/8a5ed2b16066ecd57e8d8fa26f0568ae2b8c4110ce326fe227dc55ae1c8a08a1" "q-110049/selection/b300b39d1c285318ec480ab2055413d766d70234191d2d21cf00732bbb276e37" "q-110049/selection/fc77e15eb9a2377afd527c9d69454d5c081d07665c06fccbf08478173cced3ef" "q-110049/selection/bc560fd2355788cb53b3af38d0a3c35a7a794f756632d0f2a6ef6b854c5fd9fc" "q-110049/selection/aec3820c443bdfddbde17f6efac94c74a827e3ab2e31ab50b2dbc074a87c7cf5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-110049" :question/id #uuid "4f7a31dd-33d0-5aed-bd19-1d96e4e6f5ea" :question/math-academy-id "q-110049" :question/problem "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)={arcsin}^{5}⁡(4x).$" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of arcsine is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[{arcsin}^{5}⁡(4x)] \\\\  & =5{arcsin}^{4}⁡(4x)\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(4x)] \\\\  & =5{arcsin}^{4}⁡(4x)\\cdot [\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(4x)^{2}}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4x)] \\\\  & =5{arcsin}^{4}⁡(4x)\\cdot [\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(4x)^{2}}}\\cdot 4] \\\\  & =5{arcsin}^{4}⁡(4x)\\cdot \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1-16{x}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{20{arcsin}^{4}⁡(4x)}{\\sqrt{1-16{x}^{2}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-110049/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "552973a7-4ab5-5918-83f4-15ee0e3ee052"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-110049"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-343050/field-1/4ad7bbfe8f3b5088ede679e2327d2c0a7840d365976392796da57ca15ec616eb" :answer/id #uuid "57ce04bb-17bd-556d-b90e-fc774b2b5bce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343050/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "962a6808-f67d-54e2-adfe-b0552e4eda8c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-343050/field-1/4ad7bbfe8f3b5088ede679e2327d2c0a7840d365976392796da57ca15ec616eb" :answer-field/choices ["q-343050/field-1/4ad7bbfe8f3b5088ede679e2327d2c0a7840d365976392796da57ca15ec616eb"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-343050" :question/id #uuid "2ac610b2-e98c-5a40-898f-0cdce0bf720c" :question/math-academy-id "q-343050" :question/problem "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+4\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x.$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\,$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of arccosine is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+4\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x) \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+4\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x) \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+4(-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}) \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-343050/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "93a44f44-0998-5857-9b12-de8998e370fd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-343050"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-110625/selection/6005d054c4f38f4aa765db0fd0ca6862c6ca20447652e5a0d52d09ba3f517ddf" :answer/id #uuid "3e617787-30ea-5b51-87b5-3297e7e66b2f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5x+\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110625/selection/894616b778731031da0b4253234487fd543df9835541a5c750023b3efa9e4d61" :answer/id #uuid "46662