$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(15\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x+8x) \\\\  & =15\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x)+8 \\\\  & =15(-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}})+8 \\\\  & =8-\\frac{15}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-110626/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "93a44f44-0998-5857-9b12-de8998e370fd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-110626"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73488/selection/f9ef4139ecc01c52df8a675b69befb7d511718bb776cc2a259e12311af00a853" :answer/id #uuid "474f4ee1-9c25-58c9-8138-477f5d4b33db" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73488/selection/90ed4fcc79a87aa81b393a338578a1382588f323e86b71baed488c7aed311f24" :answer/id #uuid "2e7f2dbd-d922-5cec-8739-14f594714e90" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73488/selection/ddd14d463120f41fe999d82e9ec8262c9b9cc5d450f7f536b529808f3f9ce396" :answer/id #uuid "26f8fa56-10a9-57c2-85c3-8461425bf4c3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73488/selection/a6577956ba5ece09ebba880d83247b6f8be0f746f0ceedc9819976cccb7f5bdf" :answer/id #uuid "bb18c0b6-b932-5218-a2bc-656320005aa2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73488/selection/c490d4cf40373943e7f24e33f792d3f7e9eb4d05ed7da431acad4cef753223c8" :answer/id #uuid "5087f760-e64b-5afb-a504-b14e0bd39127" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73488/selection